{"ref":"card:hypothesis","text":"More rotations recover better candidates, but unchanged scoring can rank worse poses first, separating best50 gains from rank1 losses.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:if_lever","text":"At 54000 rotations, best50 DockQ gains exceed 0.01 and calibrated noise; rank1 may decline, within common complete-workflow budgets.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:if_not","text":"At 54000 rotations, best50 gains fail 0.01 or noise thresholds, or complete workflows exceed common budgets; rank1 remains separately reported.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:test_summary","text":"Validate independent scorer and CPU/GPU standard agreement first. Calibrate complete-workflow budgets, seal noise rules, then compare three paired 3600/54000-rotation repeats on four cases, fixed 50 outputs; report rank1 and best50 separately.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:closest_prior","text":"Published MEGADOCK benchmark timed parallel execution across 30976 docking jobs; rotation maximum is unspecified here, and it does not settle four-case DockQ tradeoffs. [prior]","sources":[{"id":"prior","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25100686/","quote":"Calculation time and acceleration by parallelization among nodes on 30 976 docking jobs"}]}
{"ref":"card:left_open","text":"Whether 54000 versus 3600 rotations, fixed 50 outputs, changes best50 and rank1 differently within calibrated budgets on these four apo cases.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:anchor","text":"Reproduce independent DockQ example, then require matching CPU/GPU standard transforms, rankings and DockQ before dense quality evaluation. [dockq]","sources":[{"id":"dockq","url":"https://github.com/wallnerlab/DockQ","quote":"DockQ: 0.994"}],"value":0.994}
{"ref":"card:limits","text":"Four selected apo cases only; exposed prior quality; prospective replication, not holdout. No biological efficacy, population generalization, or ranking improvement inferred from best50 gains.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"src:dockq","url":"https://github.com/wallnerlab/DockQ","quote":"DockQ: 0.994","supports":"Documented first interface of 1A2K example provides independent scorer anchor; pin version, bytes and mapping before execution."}
{"ref":"src:prior","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25100686/","quote":"Calculation time and acceleration by parallelization among nodes on 30 976 docking jobs","supports":"Public figure caption of MEGADOCK 4.0 performance study; jobs are not rotations per search."}
